{"id": "algorithms.02.graph-representation", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/02-data-structure-selection.md", "anchor": "7. 关系结构：图的两种表示", "title": "图表示按顶点数上限与稠密程度选择", "tags": ["algorithms", "data-structure", "graph", "adjacency"], "summary": "顶点数无上限或可达万级时禁用邻接矩阵，稀疏图选邻接表；图遍历必须记录已访问顶点，不得套用树的无环假设。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-09-graph.md#效率对比"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.03.recursion-vs-iteration", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-recursion-iteration.md", "anchor": "1. 递归与迭代的选择", "title": "递归以问题可分解为同构子问题为前提", "tags": ["algorithms", "recursion", "iteration"], "summary": "无分解结构的线性任务用迭代，禁止为「代码简洁」改写为递归；选用递归须说出深度上界与输入规模的关系。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-02-complexity.md#两者对比"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.03.recursion-depth-limit", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-recursion-iteration.md", "anchor": "2. 递归深度的硬性上限", "title": "栈耗尽不可捕获，深度必须事前预防", "tags": ["algorithms", "recursion", "stack-overflow", "resource-exhaustion"], "summary": "禁止依赖捕获栈溢出（该异常不可捕获且进程终止）；深度与不受控输入同阶时须改迭代加显式栈，处理外部输入的递归解析必须设深度上限。", "source": ["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.stackoverflowexception"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.03.no-tail-call-guarantee", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-recursion-iteration.md", "anchor": "3. 尾递归不得作为深度保证", "title": "尾递归的深度安全性不可验证，不得作为设计依据", "tags": ["algorithms", "recursion", "tail-call"], "summary": "栈帧是否被消除不可从代码形态推断（尾调用请求在若干情形下被运行时忽略）；需保证不增长栈深度时须写显式循环。", "source": ["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.reflection.emit.opcodes.tailcall"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.03.recursion-recomputation", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-recursion-iteration.md", "anchor": "4. 递归的重复计算", "title": "多分支且子问题重叠的递归必须消除重复计算", "tags": ["algorithms", "recursion", "memoization"], "summary": "递归含两个及以上分支时须判断子问题是否重叠，重叠则必须消除重复；记忆化的缓存须声明键、规模上限与生命周期。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-14-dynamic-programming.md#方法二：记忆化搜索"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.03.recursion-termination", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/03-recursion-iteration.md", "anchor": "5. 递归的终止与正确性", "title": "递归须有终止条件且每次调用朝其推进", "tags": ["algorithms", "recursion", "termination"], "summary": "禁止递归参数在某条分支上不变化；可能有环的结构上须记录已访问节点；递归中修改的共享状态须在返回前恢复。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-02-complexity.md#2.2 迭代与递归"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.04.strategy-precondition", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-algorithm-strategy.md", "anchor": "1. 策略选择的共同前提", "title": "采用任一算法策略前须验证其前提条件成立", "tags": ["algorithms", "strategy", "precondition"], "summary": "禁止以「这类问题一般用 X」为选择理由；给出近似解须显式声明；优化实现与暴力解法结果不一致时以后者为准排查前提。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-10-search.md#搜索方法选取"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.04.search-strategy", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-algorithm-strategy.md", "anchor": "2. 查找策略", "title": "查找策略按预处理成本能否摊薄选择", "tags": ["algorithms", "strategy", "search", "binary-search"], "summary": "只查一次时用线性查找不做预处理；二分查找要求输入有序，无序输入给出错误结果；同一实现内禁止混用两种区间表示方式。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-10-search.md#区间表示方法", "reference/hello-algo-10-search.md#搜索方法选取"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.04.sort-strategy", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-algorithm-strategy.md", "anchor": "3. 排序策略", "title": "稳定性是排序唯一影响正确性的维度", "tags": ["algorithms", "strategy", "sort", "stability"], "summary": "依赖相等元素保持相对顺序（含多级排序）时须确认排序稳定；比较排序下界为 O(n log n)，声称 O(n) 的须验证非比较排序的前提成立。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-11-sort.md#评价维度", "reference/hello-algo-11-sort.md#理想排序算法"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.04.divide-conquer", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-algorithm-strategy.md", "anchor": "4. 分治", "title": "分治要求子问题独立，重叠时该用动态规划", "tags": ["algorithms", "strategy", "divide-conquer"], "summary": "三个条件须同时成立（可分解为同构子问题、子问题独立、解可合并）；合并步骤的复杂度计入总量级，分解不均衡时深度可退化为线性。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-12-divide-conquer.md#如何判断分治问题"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.04.dynamic-programming", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-algorithm-strategy.md", "anchor": "5. 动态规划", "title": "动态规划要求最优子结构与无后效性", "tags": ["algorithms", "strategy", "dynamic-programming"], "summary": "须确认两项性质并写出状态定义与转移方程；无后效性不成立时须补状态维度或改策略；状态表的空间峰值须声明上限。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-14-dynamic-programming.md#14.2 DP 问题特性"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.04.backtracking", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-algorithm-strategy.md", "anchor": "6. 回溯", "title": "回溯的剪枝不是优化而是可行性前提", "tags": ["algorithms", "strategy", "backtracking", "pruning"], "summary": "须给出输入规模硬上限并实施剪枝；每次尝试后必须恢复被修改的状态且与修改成对同层；去重须在分支处剪掉而非仅在收集结果时。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-13-backtracking.md#剪枝", "reference/hello-algo-13-backtracking.md#尝试与回退"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "algorithms.04.greedy", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/04-algorithm-strategy.md", "anchor": "7. 贪心", "title": "贪心的正确性须论证，不得以测试通过为依据", "tags": ["algorithms", "strategy", "greedy", "correctness"], "summary": "贪心选择性质证伪易证实难；禁止以「测试用例全部通过」作为正确依据——部分正确的策略也能通过多数用例；无法论证且要求最优解时改用 DP 或回溯。", "source": ["reference/hello-algo-15-greedy.md#贪心算法特性", "reference/hello-algo-15-greedy.md#贪心算法的优点与局限性"], "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["算法与数据结构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
